  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "Inside Profound Literature grotto-heaven, Li Xiao Bai plans to change his vital Gu to poetry Gu, practice poetic Gu and emotion poetry Gu, use gather poem Gu to gather poems externally and advance poem wall Gu, and also practice poem boundary Gu.",
        "chapters": [
          2023
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "intro",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "loc_profound_literature_grotto_heaven",
          "char_li_xiao_bai",
          "sys_vital_gu",
          "gu_poetry_gu",
          "gu_poetic_gu",
          "gu_emotion_poetry_gu",
          "gu_gather_poem_gu",
          "gu_poem_boundary_gu"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "Fang Yuan sees Li Xiao Bai’s luck change into a white wall with three poems of different lengths whose letters are pitch-black on the white wall, while countless dark inky characters fly around the wall about to enter it. Fang Yuan names that form poem wall luck. After the Book House inheritance, Li Xiao Bai changes his vital Gu, collects poems, and forms three killer moves from poems he created, copied, and stole.",
        "chapters": [
          2081
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "poem-wall-luck",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
        "mentions": [
          "char_fang_yuan",
          "house_book_house"
        ]
      },
      {
        "text": "During Li Xiao Bai’s immortal ascension, he uses a killer move and creates a poem wall that blocks a lightning ball.",
        "chapters": [
          2119
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
        "section": "tribulation-wall",
        "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
      },
      {
        "text": "When tribulation lightning strikes again, he creates another poem wall; the wall breaks, but most of the lightning’s might is blocked and only pale green fire remains on his body.",
        "chapters": [
          2120
        ],
        "certainty": "canon",
        "confidence": "B",
        "verification": "citation_unchecked",
        "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
